    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317224</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSS_039_020_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>見つけてくれて
サンキュー！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, you found me!
Thank you~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317224</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSS_039_020_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ご褒美よ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Here, a reward!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317308</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSS_039_020_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……では、サラバっ！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...And with that... Farewell!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Npc</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308592</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は頭領の右腕を
務めさせてもらっている</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I pursue the duties of the
clan head's right hand man.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308592</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>このたびは大変失礼した。
本来は我らの失態、頭領のお手を
煩わせるのは不本意だが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We have been particularly rude to you.
Normally, we would not allow our faults
to trouble the head herself, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>プルートの居場所をつきとめ、
討伐が目的、参謀である私が
ここを動くわけにはいかぬ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I am an officer tasked with ascertaining
Pluto's whereabouts and subjugating
him, and cannot abandon my duties.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>かと言って、頭領に
動かれるのもマズイが、
この際仕方がない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Though, it's also awful for the clan
head to be distracted from hers,
but this time, there's no helping it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>このたびは、我が采配の
不徳の致すところ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This has been a failure on
my part, as a commander...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>皆様のお手をお借りすることに
なろうとは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Being in need of a helping
hand from all of you...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よろしくお願いする……
この世界のため、なにとぞ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Please do all you can to assist us.
For the sake of our world, I beg you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我らはこの里を守るため、
ここにとどまっておる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We will remain here
to protect our village.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すべてお任せすることになり、
大変無念で、大変申し訳ないが、
後はお願いした……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Imposing our tasks upon you is both a
great chagrin and a great impropriety,
but... Please handle the rest.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>頭領はわずか１２歳にして
この里をとりまとめる
頭領をしっかり務めてらっしゃる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Our clan head has worked in that
capacity and functioned as the
core of our village since she was 12.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しかし、時折１２歳の
子どもらしい顔も見せられるのが
魅力でもあるのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, her expressions are
sometimes still befitting of her
age. There is a charm in that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私のような大人でも時々、
舌を巻くような力を頭領が
発揮されることがある</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The head is sometimes able to
display such power as to astonish
even grown adults like myself.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなすごい頭領のそばに
お仕えできてまったく光栄である</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I am extremely proud to pursue my
duties by her accomplished side.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308616</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Suzu&gt;様、銅蔵様と二代に渡り、
おそばに仕えしている。
銅蔵様のことは残念だったが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I have pursued duties beside two
heads—Lady Suzu and Lord Kanzou.
Lord Kanzou's end was regrettable.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308616</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そのことについて、あまり
ご本人の口から話されることは
ないが、おそらく……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I have heard sparingly
little of the matter pass
her lips, but, I fear...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308616</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや、忘れてくれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No, forget I mentioned it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308620</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>頭領のご両親のことは……
知らぬのか……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Do you not know...about
the clan head's parents...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308620</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだな、頭領が自ら話すことも
ないだろう、いや、忘れてくれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, it's true the head herself does
not speak of it. Forget I mentioned it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308624</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>最近ようやく、頭領直下の
戦闘部隊に配属になった
彗蔵でござる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I am merely Keizou, who has recently
acceded to a position which reports
directly to our clan head.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308624</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でござるが、こたびの戦いでは、
この村を守る後衛に
配されたでござるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Though, due to my limited power,
in our current battle, the most I can
manage is to defend the village.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308628</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それでも拙者は拙者に与えれた
任務を忠実にこなすだけに
ござるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Be that as it may, I will do
all within that limited power
to faithfully carry out my duties.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308628</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>不満を申すなどとんでもない。
若輩たる我も里のために戦える
なら本望にござる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There is no dissatisfaction for me to
express. As inexperienced as I am,
defending the village is an honour.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308632</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我らの仲間がプルートの本拠で
命を落としたでござるよ。
残念無念、恐縮至極にござる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Our allies have fallen in battle at Pluto's
stronghold. It is deeply regrettable,
but we are grateful for their sacrifice.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308632</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もし、あの場に拙者がいたなら
あのようなことになっていない
……こともないでござるかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder, had I been there to assist
them, would this disaster have been
averted...? Realistically, I guess not...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308636</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もはや、我が里にプルートの
魔物の軍勢に立ち向かえるだけの
力があるかどうか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>At this stage, there are doubts as
to whether we have enough power
to fend off Pluto's army of monsters...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308636</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>残された者たちも決して
弱くはないでござるが、
頭領がどう判断されるか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Those who remain are
certainly not weak, but... I
wonder what the head thinks...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308640</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ようやく世界にも
平和が訪れたでござる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>At last, peace has
returned to our world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308640</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だが、いつの世もどこにでも
謀議を持つ者がいるもの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yet, there are those who would
plot and scheme in every age.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308640</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我らは常に
気が抜けぬでござる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We must never
relax our guard.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308644</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我らが願いはこの世界の
安寧でござる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Our sincerest wish is
for true peace to
persist in this world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308644</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そのため、我らは未知なる敵と
戦うのでござる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>For that reason, we do
all within our power to fight
against unseen foes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>戦闘要員が、対プルート戦で
ずいぶん減ってしまったでござる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Our combatants have declined
markedly in number through the
course of our war against Pluto.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>来る次なる戦いには
おそらく拙者も前線に投入される
でござろうな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I suspect my humble self may be
deployed to the front lines whenever
our next battle should arrive.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308652</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>次なる戦いのために
鍛錬の日々は死ぬその日まで
続くのでござる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I must train tirelessly until the end
of my days, so that I may carry out
my duties in each battle and the next.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308652</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>明日、どこで果てるとも
悔いはござらん。
任務の果てに命尽きるのならば</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I harbour no fear, whatever end tomorrow
may lead me toward...so long as that life
is consumed at the conclusion of my duties.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308652</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>プルートを倒せず、
志半ばにして果てた仲間たちは
無念であったでござろうな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can only imagine the regrets
harboured by those who met
their ends before Pluto's defeat.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308656</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここは風呂です。
戦いに傷を負ったならば
ぜひ、癒していってください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>These are the baths. If you've
been wounded in battle, by all
means, heal yourselves here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308656</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……いえ、覗こうなど、
そんな滅相もない……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...No, I will not take a
peek! Absolutely not...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここの風呂は、地下から
湧いて出ている温泉です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This bath is sourced from a
subterranean hotspring.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>血行不良・関節痛・火傷
慢性頭痛・悪性腫瘍などの
治療によく効きます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's very effective for treating poor
circulation, arthritis, burns, chronic
headaches, cancer, etc.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308664</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここは風呂です。
手前が女風呂、
奥が男風呂です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>These are the baths.
In front are the women's,
and in back are the men's.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308664</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>女性の方は手前へ、
男性の方は奥へ、
お間違えなきよう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Women should proceed to the front,
and men should proceed to the back.
Please do avoid any mistakes...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308668</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は男風呂と女風呂を
間違える人がいないか、
ここで見張っております</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I stand watch here to ensure
no one confuses the doors to
the men's and to the women's.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308668</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いえ、私が覗くなど、
そんなことは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No, I don't peek or anything.
Of course I don't...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308672</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここは風呂です。
温かいお湯は体だけでなく
心も癒してくれます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>These are the baths. The warmth
of the water heals not only the
body, but also the mind.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308672</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ご要望あらば、
お背中も流しますよ。
ご遠慮なく申しつけください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Upon request, I can also help
wash your backs for you.
Please don't hesitate to ask.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308676</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>風呂の中ではみな裸、
つまりみな同等の立場です。
まさに裸のつきあい、無礼講です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In the baths, everyone is nude,
which means everyone stands equal.
Socialising in the nude is very freeing.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>308676</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>時々、森の動物たちが
入っていることもあるかも
しれませんが仲良くお願いします</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>From time to time, the animals of
the forest may also wander in.
Please treat them well, if so.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
